1
00:00:01,763 --> 00:00:04,433
[Anzu] Come on, Hijiri,
I already told you.

2
00:00:05,016 --> 00:00:06,935
Don't bother asking me out.

3
00:00:07,978 --> 00:00:10,939
But Tsuchiya said,
that meant I should ask you out.

4
00:00:11,023 --> 00:00:12,190
Tsuchiya!

5
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,942
Sincerest apologies.

6
00:00:14,651 --> 00:00:16,945
[Hijiri] I looked into
some places normal folk enjoy.

7
00:00:17,738 --> 00:00:20,198
I'd appreciate it
if you'd show some gratitude

8
00:00:20,282 --> 00:00:22,159
that you are able to date me.

9
00:00:22,242 --> 00:00:23,952
[mimics choking]

10
00:00:24,745 --> 00:00:26,413
[sighs]
I'm not a realistic

11
00:00:26,496 --> 00:00:28,915
potential romantic partner for you, am I?

12
00:00:28,999 --> 00:00:30,459
What are you saying?

13
00:00:30,542 --> 00:00:32,919
I'll have you know,
every woman in the world sees me

14
00:00:33,003 --> 00:00:35,464
as a potential romantic partner for them.

15
00:00:36,047 --> 00:00:38,508
All right. I'm about to beat you at drums.

16
00:00:38,592 --> 00:00:40,343
No whining if I hit you by accident.

17
00:00:40,427 --> 00:00:42,471
Sorry, that one's not interesting.

18
00:00:44,181 --> 00:00:45,974
Why don't we play this one over here?

19
00:00:47,142 --> 00:00:47,976
Oh.

20
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:51,480
That plushie toy I wanted
last time is still there.

21
00:00:52,064 --> 00:00:54,649
Rio took all of our prizes home
that night.

22
00:00:54,733 --> 00:00:56,234
-What?
-Hmm?

23
00:00:56,318 --> 00:00:57,903
I'd still plan a better date.

24
00:00:57,986 --> 00:01:00,280
There's no way
you know her as well as I do.

25
00:01:01,073 --> 00:01:02,908
Your disrespectful cousin.

26
00:01:03,867 --> 00:01:06,745
-All right, I'll buy everything in there.
-[snaps fingers]

27
00:01:06,828 --> 00:01:09,039
Will my paycheck cover it, Tsuchiya?

28
00:01:09,122 --> 00:01:10,749
Allow me to check with the manager.

29
00:01:10,832 --> 00:01:12,793
[Anzu] Just play the game, please!

30
00:01:12,876 --> 00:01:16,004
Why bother with that part of it?
I really don't understand.

31
00:01:16,088 --> 00:01:16,922
[Anzu] Hmm.

32
00:01:17,005 --> 00:01:19,090
Hey, I know. Let's hit the photo booth.

33
00:01:19,591 --> 00:01:22,177
-Whoa!
-Mr. Tsuchiya, come on!

34
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,428
You want me in it?

35
00:01:23,512 --> 00:01:24,429
[Anzu] Yup.

36
00:01:25,388 --> 00:01:27,390
[cheerful music]

37
00:01:29,976 --> 00:01:31,561
[Anzu] Hurry, Mr. Tsuchiya!

38
00:01:32,062 --> 00:01:32,938
[Tsuchiya] Yes, miss.

39
00:01:38,193 --> 00:01:40,070
-[Tsuchiya grunts]
-[automated voice] Give me a hot pose!

40
00:01:40,153 --> 00:01:41,738
-Oh. Right there, the camera.
-Hmm.

41
00:01:41,822 --> 00:01:44,616
-[automated voice] Three, two, one.
-[exclaims]

42
00:01:44,699 --> 00:01:45,784
[camera clicks]

43
00:01:46,451 --> 00:01:47,285
SP TRIO

44
00:01:47,369 --> 00:01:49,704
[Anzu] Somehow we do always end up
having fun together.

45
00:01:51,623 --> 00:01:53,917
-[Yukana] Miss Anzu Hoshino.
-Hmm?

46
00:01:55,335 --> 00:01:56,795
Nice to meet you.

47
00:01:57,462 --> 00:01:59,506
How are you? My name's Yukana Kishi.

48
00:02:00,423 --> 00:02:03,802
Tsukasa, he lives with you
at your place, isn't that right?

49
00:02:05,053 --> 00:02:06,513
Um…

50
00:02:08,098 --> 00:02:09,307
We've been together,

51
00:02:10,350 --> 00:02:13,436
for, well, I'd say for quite a while now.

52
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,230
[insects chirruping]

53
00:02:20,026 --> 00:02:22,028
[theme music]

54
00:03:46,154 --> 00:03:49,199
#11 JUST TELL ME IF YOU DON'T LIKE IT

55
00:03:49,282 --> 00:03:50,367
Mr. Hijiri.

56
00:03:50,450 --> 00:03:51,451
[Hijiri] What is it?

57
00:03:51,534 --> 00:03:55,121
Well, I thought I was seeing things,
so I kept quiet at first.

58
00:03:55,956 --> 00:03:58,917
But I could sense someone's eye
on us all day today.

59
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,043
[gasps]

60
00:04:00,126 --> 00:04:02,504
[Tsuchiya] We parted ways
with Miss Hoshino at the station,

61
00:04:02,587 --> 00:04:04,256
but I must say I'm concerned.

62
00:04:07,259 --> 00:04:08,718
I can check up on her.

63
00:04:10,011 --> 00:04:12,472
[Anzu] So you're Kazuki's, uh, girlfriend?

64
00:04:12,555 --> 00:04:13,723
Yes, I am.

65
00:04:13,807 --> 00:04:16,643
But everybody who's close to us is
against it for some reason,

66
00:04:16,726 --> 00:04:18,853
so I'm never allowed to see him anymore.

67
00:04:19,562 --> 00:04:21,022
[Yukana] It's terrible, isn't it?

68
00:04:21,523 --> 00:04:23,858
Tearing lovers apart that way?

69
00:04:23,942 --> 00:04:25,110
[Anzu] I don't know.

70
00:04:25,193 --> 00:04:28,238
I just don't see Kazuki
being with someone like her.

71
00:04:28,822 --> 00:04:31,366
[Yukana] His sister
is truly an evil person,

72
00:04:31,449 --> 00:04:34,244
the complete opposite of my sweet Tsukasa.

73
00:04:34,327 --> 00:04:35,870
[Anzu] I just don't know.

74
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:38,123
Something feels off.

75
00:04:38,206 --> 00:04:40,208
[foreboding music]

76
00:04:46,798 --> 00:04:47,841
[uneasy sigh]

77
00:04:50,427 --> 00:04:52,137
I've been searching frantically

78
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,972
because no one would tell me
where he moved.

79
00:04:54,931 --> 00:04:57,017
And I found him thanks to social media.

80
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:59,019
WITH CHOYO. LOOK AT THE HOTTIE
IN THE BACKGROUND.

81
00:04:59,102 --> 00:05:00,603
[Anzu] What?

82
00:05:04,816 --> 00:05:06,234
[Tsukasa gasps]

83
00:05:06,318 --> 00:05:07,527
[thuds]

84
00:05:08,403 --> 00:05:09,529
[Yukana gasps]

85
00:05:10,363 --> 00:05:12,949
How come… you're…

86
00:05:14,117 --> 00:05:16,411
[Yukana] Tsukasa!

87
00:05:20,123 --> 00:05:22,500
[Anzu] Whoa, this is bad.

88
00:05:23,877 --> 00:05:25,503
[Tsukasa gasps anxiously]

89
00:05:31,009 --> 00:05:32,927
I'm sorry, but he's busy.

90
00:05:33,970 --> 00:05:35,930
So please, time for you to leave.

91
00:05:36,014 --> 00:05:38,016
[pensive music]

92
00:05:44,773 --> 00:05:46,232
[exhales deeply]

93
00:05:48,526 --> 00:05:50,737
[breathing heavily]

94
00:05:52,530 --> 00:05:55,033
[Anzu] Man,
Kazuki's really sweating over there.

95
00:05:56,242 --> 00:05:57,077
Hmm.

96
00:06:07,003 --> 00:06:08,296
[sighs in relief]

97
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,466
[Anzu] She's gone now, Kazuki.

98
00:06:12,675 --> 00:06:15,512
[Tsukasa] How did she,
how did she approach you?

99
00:06:16,012 --> 00:06:19,349
Well, she called out my name
when I was walking home.

100
00:06:22,018 --> 00:06:25,021
[Anzu] Then she told me
that she was your girlfriend.

101
00:06:25,105 --> 00:06:25,939
[retches]

102
00:06:26,981 --> 00:06:28,066
[Anzu] Kazuki!

103
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:31,111
-[retching]
-[Anzu gasps]

104
00:06:31,194 --> 00:06:33,655
[Tsukasa in hoarse voice]
And, did you, did you believe her?

105
00:06:33,738 --> 00:06:34,572
Mm-mm.

106
00:06:35,698 --> 00:06:38,076
-No, I didn't. Something felt off.
-[Tsukasa grunts]

107
00:06:38,993 --> 00:06:40,078
[exhales sharply]

108
00:06:41,287 --> 00:06:43,998
[groans weakly]

109
00:06:44,999 --> 00:06:46,167
She's, uh…

110
00:06:47,252 --> 00:06:48,461
[Tsukasa] She's my stalker.

111
00:06:48,962 --> 00:06:49,963
What?

112
00:06:50,672 --> 00:06:53,591
[eerie music]

113
00:06:58,638 --> 00:07:01,099
[Tsukasa] I'm starting
to feel a lot better now.

114
00:07:01,599 --> 00:07:03,935
[Anzu] I'll get you
something to drink. Uh?

115
00:07:07,063 --> 00:07:08,690
Stay with me a little longer.

116
00:07:10,442 --> 00:07:13,653
[Anzu] Jeez, his hands are super cold.

117
00:07:15,238 --> 00:07:16,239
Sorry.

118
00:07:16,322 --> 00:07:17,449
[Anzu] It's okay.

119
00:07:17,532 --> 00:07:21,119
I'm really sorry too.
I shouldn't have even talked to her.

120
00:07:22,162 --> 00:07:23,580
It's not your fault.

121
00:07:24,205 --> 00:07:27,083
Knowing how she is,
she already had your address.

122
00:07:28,084 --> 00:07:29,127
[Tsukasa] Anyway.

123
00:07:32,297 --> 00:07:34,466
You knew. You could sense it.

124
00:07:34,966 --> 00:07:36,426
[sighs softly]

125
00:07:38,178 --> 00:07:41,806
Well, I did say I would tell you
why I was living alone.

126
00:07:43,266 --> 00:07:45,351
You shouldn't feel pressured
to talk about it.

127
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:51,900
I want to, Hoshino.

128
00:07:51,983 --> 00:07:53,151
[gasps]

129
00:07:53,234 --> 00:07:54,611
[Tsukasa] Here's how it happened.

130
00:07:54,694 --> 00:07:55,737
[Yukana grunts]

131
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:57,822
-You know that book I wanted?
-Oh yeah.

132
00:07:57,906 --> 00:07:59,699
-Well, dude, I really--
-Huh?

133
00:07:59,782 --> 00:08:01,409
[hurried footsteps]

134
00:08:01,493 --> 00:08:02,577
[Tsukasa] Are you okay?

135
00:08:04,662 --> 00:08:05,914
Here.

136
00:08:10,293 --> 00:08:12,545
[gasps]

137
00:08:12,629 --> 00:08:13,963
[Yukana] Thank you very much.

138
00:08:14,464 --> 00:08:16,674
[Tsukasa] All I did was give her the bag.

139
00:08:16,758 --> 00:08:18,676
[rain pattering]

140
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:21,179
-Hey, remember that book?
-Yeah, did you get it?

141
00:08:21,262 --> 00:08:22,764
-[boy 1] I did, man, for nearly after…
-Morning.

142
00:08:22,847 --> 00:08:24,182
Oh. Good morning.

143
00:08:27,143 --> 00:08:28,186
Morning.

144
00:08:29,145 --> 00:08:30,188
Morning.

145
00:08:31,523 --> 00:08:32,774
[gasps]

146
00:08:32,857 --> 00:08:34,317
[Tsukasa in weak voice]
Hello.

147
00:08:35,777 --> 00:08:38,154
That chick's here for you,
like, every day.

148
00:08:38,238 --> 00:08:39,072
Mm-hm.

149
00:08:39,155 --> 00:08:41,282
Hey, she must like you a lot, my dude.

150
00:08:42,492 --> 00:08:44,160
[Tsukasa] Nah,
I'm sure it's not like that.

151
00:08:44,244 --> 00:08:46,621
[boy 1] Man, it must be nice
to be so good-looking.

152
00:08:47,205 --> 00:08:48,581
[doorbell dings]

153
00:08:48,665 --> 00:08:49,707
[delivery man] Delivery.

154
00:08:49,791 --> 00:08:50,833
TO: TSUKASA KAZUKI

155
00:08:50,917 --> 00:08:51,960
For me?

156
00:08:52,043 --> 00:08:54,045
[foreboding music]

157
00:08:56,422 --> 00:08:57,257
Hmm.

158
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:00,593
Hmm?

159
00:09:05,181 --> 00:09:06,975
And it totally freaked me out.

160
00:09:07,058 --> 00:09:09,602
-That makes sense.
-Hey, Mom, about this shirt…

161
00:09:09,686 --> 00:09:11,479
Oh, is that a new one?

162
00:09:11,563 --> 00:09:13,064
Did Arisa get it for you?

163
00:09:13,147 --> 00:09:15,108
What? No, I didn't get it for him.

164
00:09:15,692 --> 00:09:17,860
Huh?
[sighs]

165
00:09:17,944 --> 00:09:19,821
[boy 2] No, dude,
it was just like I thought.

166
00:09:19,904 --> 00:09:20,863
[boy 1] He's confiscating everything.

167
00:09:20,947 --> 00:09:22,448
-So your brother had…
-Oh, really? That's crazy.

168
00:09:22,532 --> 00:09:23,366
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

169
00:09:23,449 --> 00:09:25,618
That dude would take
all my stuff without asking.

170
00:09:25,702 --> 00:09:26,869
[Yukana] Morning.

171
00:09:27,453 --> 00:09:30,373
-That shirt looks so good on you.
-[Tsukasa gasps]

172
00:09:31,332 --> 00:09:32,333
What?

173
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,003
[doorbell dings]

174
00:09:36,546 --> 00:09:39,257
[breathes heavily]

175
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:44,429
[doorbell dinging]

176
00:09:44,971 --> 00:09:48,016
[cutlery clinking]

177
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,018
[Tsukasa's mom] So disturbing.

178
00:09:50,101 --> 00:09:52,687
Someone created multiple accounts
for different websites

179
00:09:52,770 --> 00:09:54,522
using my name without my permission.

180
00:09:54,606 --> 00:09:57,025
Thank goodness
the purchases weren't billed to you.

181
00:09:57,108 --> 00:09:58,776
But this is still serious.

182
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:00,528
I think we should speak to the police.

183
00:10:01,321 --> 00:10:04,032
[Tsukasa's dad] There's no reason
to involve the police. Shame on you!

184
00:10:04,907 --> 00:10:05,950
Tsukasa.

185
00:10:06,034 --> 00:10:09,037
You're making these purchases
using your mom's name, aren't you?

186
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,288
-No--
-Do you really think

187
00:10:10,371 --> 00:10:12,040
Tsukasa would ever do that?

188
00:10:12,123 --> 00:10:14,417
-Don't talk to your father that way.
-Huh…

189
00:10:14,500 --> 00:10:15,543
[Arisa sighs]

190
00:10:15,627 --> 00:10:19,422
[Tsukasa's mom] Anyway, let's just
return the packages unopened for now.

191
00:10:22,634 --> 00:10:25,428
[Yukana] Tsukasa,
you like the gifts I send?

192
00:10:26,638 --> 00:10:29,432
[Tsukasa] I knew it. You sent everything.

193
00:10:30,224 --> 00:10:31,559
Hmm.

194
00:10:31,643 --> 00:10:33,311
[Tsukasa] Why are you doing this?

195
00:10:33,978 --> 00:10:36,773
Oh. I'm sorry,
I didn't mean to bother you.

196
00:10:37,357 --> 00:10:39,817
I should have asked
what kind of clothes you like first.

197
00:10:40,485 --> 00:10:42,153
[Tsukasa] No, that's not what I mean.

198
00:10:42,236 --> 00:10:44,322
You made a bunch of accounts
using my mom's name.

199
00:10:44,405 --> 00:10:48,451
Well I, I haven't really met
your family yet, so,

200
00:10:48,534 --> 00:10:50,703
are you worried about what they may think?

201
00:10:51,746 --> 00:10:53,414
Embarrassed if they found out about us?

202
00:10:54,415 --> 00:10:55,833
[Tsukasa] What are you…
[gasps]

203
00:10:55,917 --> 00:10:57,335
So…

204
00:10:58,419 --> 00:10:59,796
What clothes do you like, then?

205
00:11:00,922 --> 00:11:02,840
[Yukana] Just tell me, Tsukasa.

206
00:11:03,758 --> 00:11:06,677
[scared gasps, breathing nervously]

207
00:11:11,432 --> 00:11:13,851
Please, just don't send me anything else

208
00:11:13,935 --> 00:11:16,020
ever again. Just leave me alone.

209
00:11:16,104 --> 00:11:18,106
[melancholy music]

210
00:11:22,610 --> 00:11:24,153
-[boy 2] Hey, so check it out.
-What's up?

211
00:11:24,237 --> 00:11:25,530
Remember what my big brother did?

212
00:11:25,613 --> 00:11:27,698
-No.
-[boy 2] Well, I ratted him out to my mom.

213
00:11:27,782 --> 00:11:28,866
-[boy 2 laughs]
-[boy 1] It's pretty crazy, right?

214
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:30,118
[boy 2] No way, dude.

215
00:11:30,868 --> 00:11:33,830
Hey, isn't that the girl who waits
for you, like, every single morning?

216
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:36,124
What? Uh, I don't know.

217
00:11:36,207 --> 00:11:37,542
-Hmm?
-Hmm.

218
00:11:37,625 --> 00:11:39,544
[rain pattering]

219
00:11:43,631 --> 00:11:45,550
[breathing nervously]

220
00:11:45,633 --> 00:11:47,885
[boy 2] See you later, dude.
Have fun tonight.

221
00:11:48,553 --> 00:11:50,680
-[student 1] Yay!
-[student 2] We have a test tomorrow.

222
00:11:50,763 --> 00:11:52,056
[scared gasp]

223
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:54,559
[eerie music]

224
00:11:54,642 --> 00:11:55,685
[Tsukasa gasps]

225
00:12:07,864 --> 00:12:10,283
[moaning]

226
00:12:10,366 --> 00:12:12,785
[suspenseful music]

227
00:12:12,869 --> 00:12:14,871
[grunting]

228
00:12:20,751 --> 00:12:23,588
[Yukana] Oh, Tsukasa,
you're so shy, aren't you?

229
00:12:24,797 --> 00:12:28,176
I understand that you don't want anyone
close to you to know about us.

230
00:12:29,886 --> 00:12:32,430
Since I still get to see you every day,

231
00:12:32,513 --> 00:12:35,266
I can suffer
through us not being able to speak.

232
00:12:36,476 --> 00:12:38,269
My sweet Tsukasa.

233
00:12:39,228 --> 00:12:40,396
Seems everyone else…

234
00:12:41,481 --> 00:12:42,523
is in the way.

235
00:12:42,607 --> 00:12:44,025
GIRLS MY AGE ARE ANNOYING AND CREEPY

236
00:12:44,108 --> 00:12:45,526
ALL GUYS ARE IMMATURE.
I WISH THEY LEFT ME ALONE.

237
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:48,654
[boy 2] Isn't that the chick who's always
waiting for you on our way to school?

238
00:12:48,738 --> 00:12:51,115
[girl 1] Excuse me,
you're dating older women now?

239
00:12:51,199 --> 00:12:52,200
SECOND ACCOUNT OF A STUDENT.
MAINLY COMPLAINTS.

240
00:12:52,283 --> 00:12:54,285
[boy 3] Dude, how are you
gonna talk trash about us online?

241
00:12:54,368 --> 00:12:56,078
[girl 2] She's obviously
trying to get with me.

242
00:12:56,162 --> 00:12:57,413
He can't just diss me like that.

243
00:12:57,497 --> 00:12:58,748
[boy 4] What the hell is that post, dude?

244
00:12:58,831 --> 00:13:00,541
[girl 3] Tsukasa, you're legit the worst.

245
00:13:00,625 --> 00:13:02,710
[boy 2] I can't believe
you're so two-faced, man!

246
00:13:03,961 --> 00:13:05,963
-[smacks]
-[Tsukasa's mom and Arisa gasp]

247
00:13:06,047 --> 00:13:07,006
[Arisa] Hey!

248
00:13:07,798 --> 00:13:09,675
[Tsukasa's dad]
You have some woman following you

249
00:13:09,759 --> 00:13:11,344
who put a wire and a camera on you?

250
00:13:11,427 --> 00:13:12,678
Disgraceful!

251
00:13:12,762 --> 00:13:14,388
It's not Tsukasa's fault, Dad!

252
00:13:14,472 --> 00:13:16,182
He is the victim here.

253
00:13:16,265 --> 00:13:18,351
[Tsukasa's dad] This happened
because you lead her on.

254
00:13:18,434 --> 00:13:19,977
You're not sincere with people.

255
00:13:25,566 --> 00:13:27,193
-[Yukana] Tsukasa.
-[gasps]

256
00:13:28,069 --> 00:13:29,195
This is awful.

257
00:13:29,278 --> 00:13:30,112
[breathing nervously]

258
00:13:30,196 --> 00:13:32,990
All everyone wants to do was
pull us apart.

259
00:13:33,741 --> 00:13:36,285
And we're so deeply in love
with each other--

260
00:13:36,369 --> 00:13:37,703
-[slams]
-[Tsukasa gasps]

261
00:13:37,787 --> 00:13:38,996
-[Arisa pants]
-[Yukana groans]

262
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:41,999
Go away!
We have a restraining order against you!

263
00:13:42,083 --> 00:13:45,002
So unless you wanna spend
the rest of your life in jail,

264
00:13:45,628 --> 00:13:47,630
don't come near my brother ever again!

265
00:13:47,713 --> 00:13:49,006
[Yukana shudders]

266
00:13:50,299 --> 00:13:51,551
[Tsukasa] I'm off to school.

267
00:13:52,677 --> 00:13:53,511
[Tsukasa sighs]

268
00:13:54,428 --> 00:13:55,513
[breathing nervously]

269
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:59,392
[twisted chuckle]

270
00:14:00,309 --> 00:14:02,520
[laughing]

271
00:14:02,603 --> 00:14:05,523
[distorted chatter]

272
00:14:07,275 --> 00:14:08,192
[Tsukasa grunts]

273
00:14:08,734 --> 00:14:11,529
[sobbing]

274
00:14:12,989 --> 00:14:15,533
[sighs]
Tsukasa.

275
00:14:17,493 --> 00:14:18,703
[Tsukasa] And after all that,

276
00:14:19,412 --> 00:14:20,997
I couldn't even go to school.

277
00:14:22,915 --> 00:14:25,459
[Tsukasa] If only I hadn't stopped
to pick up her bag.

278
00:14:26,085 --> 00:14:29,547
And if… I regretted that moment
again and again in my head,

279
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:30,548
I still do.

280
00:14:32,633 --> 00:14:36,470
My homeroom teacher,
my mom, and Arisa helped me.

281
00:14:37,138 --> 00:14:38,389
And I moved away.

282
00:14:38,973 --> 00:14:42,018
And started living alone
so no one could find my address.

283
00:14:43,561 --> 00:14:46,522
I got to a place
where I could live a normal life,

284
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:50,818
but I still feel sick when people stare,
and when girls approach me.

285
00:14:52,445 --> 00:14:55,907
I'm just a spineless loser
so all I can do is be cold,

286
00:14:55,990 --> 00:14:58,075
and put up walls to protect myself.

287
00:14:59,201 --> 00:15:03,998
Even when my dad came at me,
I was too weak to defend myself.

288
00:15:05,499 --> 00:15:06,667
All of it happened

289
00:15:07,335 --> 00:15:10,463
because I don't make genuine relationships
and let people in.

290
00:15:11,047 --> 00:15:13,674
None of my classmates believed
a word that I said,

291
00:15:14,342 --> 00:15:16,052
and all of it is my fault.

292
00:15:16,552 --> 00:15:18,304
[sobs]

293
00:15:19,388 --> 00:15:22,475
Kazuki, stop me if you hate it.

294
00:15:23,059 --> 00:15:24,977
-[Anzu] 'Cause I'm gonna hug you now.
-[gasps]

295
00:15:26,145 --> 00:15:27,438
[surprised gasp]

296
00:15:27,521 --> 00:15:29,815
[melancholy music]

297
00:15:29,899 --> 00:15:32,068
None of this is any of your fault.

298
00:15:33,069 --> 00:15:34,946
-I'm so mad.
-[Tsukasa gasps]

299
00:15:35,029 --> 00:15:36,989
[Anzu] If only
we had become friends sooner.

300
00:15:37,782 --> 00:15:41,077
I would have believed you,
even when nobody else did.

301
00:15:44,038 --> 00:15:45,122
[sobs]

302
00:15:45,623 --> 00:15:49,335
I feel the same way.
I wish I had met you sooner too.

303
00:15:53,130 --> 00:15:55,049
[Arisa] I went ahead
and contacted the police.

304
00:15:56,050 --> 00:15:58,052
We're gonna have to be guarded
for a while.

305
00:15:58,552 --> 00:16:00,638
I'm sorry you're dealing with this.

306
00:16:01,639 --> 00:16:02,932
[Tsukasa] It's because I'm weak.

307
00:16:03,557 --> 00:16:04,850
It's so embarrassing.

308
00:16:06,143 --> 00:16:07,645
[Anzu] Hey, that's not true.

309
00:16:09,355 --> 00:16:11,899
Don't worry. I'm right here.

310
00:16:11,983 --> 00:16:13,985
[soft guitar music]

311
00:16:14,068 --> 00:16:15,236
[Arisa sighs]

312
00:16:15,319 --> 00:16:17,571
[Arisa] Social media
can be really problematic.

313
00:16:17,655 --> 00:16:20,116
I can't believe how fast she found you.

314
00:16:20,199 --> 00:16:21,075
Hmm.

315
00:16:22,827 --> 00:16:26,080
Well, I'll stay over on the days
that I don't have to work.

316
00:16:26,163 --> 00:16:28,040
You don't have to do that.

317
00:16:29,625 --> 00:16:31,377
I'm sure you're busy as well.

318
00:16:34,338 --> 00:16:36,173
[sighs]
Listen.

319
00:16:37,508 --> 00:16:40,594
I know you're mature for your age,
but you're still just a kid.

320
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:44,598
[Arisa] So, let people help you
when you need it.

321
00:16:46,183 --> 00:16:47,101
[slams]

322
00:16:47,184 --> 00:16:49,103
[Yukana's mom]
Would you let it go with this kid?

323
00:16:50,604 --> 00:16:54,150
[frustrated sigh]
You're causing too much trouble now.

324
00:16:54,233 --> 00:16:58,529
We can't just keep running
to your uncle every time you do this.

325
00:16:58,612 --> 00:17:01,824
Jeez, I don't believe any of this
would have happened

326
00:17:01,907 --> 00:17:04,035
if this damn guy didn't lead you on…

327
00:17:04,118 --> 00:17:06,162
Don't say that about Tsukasa!

328
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:10,332
[Yukana] When I was getting bullied
at work every day,

329
00:17:11,584 --> 00:17:14,128
Tsukasa was such a sweetheart to me.

330
00:17:15,463 --> 00:17:17,381
Every day, he would come visit.

331
00:17:18,466 --> 00:17:21,677
And we talked about,
well, anything all day.

332
00:17:23,137 --> 00:17:24,472
[Yukana's mom exhales heavily]

333
00:17:24,555 --> 00:17:26,682
[Yukana's mom]
How could he do this to you?

334
00:17:26,766 --> 00:17:28,768
I wanna take him to court.

335
00:17:29,977 --> 00:17:30,811
[door opens]

336
00:17:30,895 --> 00:17:33,064
[Yukana] We were only
seeing each other, nothing more.

337
00:17:33,147 --> 00:17:34,023
[Yukana sobs]

338
00:17:34,106 --> 00:17:36,400
It's not anybody else's business but ours.

339
00:17:36,984 --> 00:17:41,489
And now yet another girl
is getting too close to my Tsukasa!

340
00:17:42,531 --> 00:17:44,742
[exhales sharply]

341
00:17:49,163 --> 00:17:50,498
She's in the way.

342
00:17:52,291 --> 00:17:55,419
[manager] Ah, Hoshino,
you can go after you finish cleaning that.

343
00:17:56,170 --> 00:17:57,004
Okay.

344
00:18:00,216 --> 00:18:03,511
What's up? You don't normally look upset.

345
00:18:04,011 --> 00:18:05,429
Huh? Um…

346
00:18:06,305 --> 00:18:07,515
Uh…

347
00:18:08,265 --> 00:18:09,433
Yeah…

348
00:18:10,726 --> 00:18:12,520
[Hijiri] We don't have
any customers right now,

349
00:18:12,603 --> 00:18:14,438
so I'm happy to lend you an ear.

350
00:18:15,689 --> 00:18:19,902
But don't get excited, I'm not worried
about you or anything silly like that.

351
00:18:19,985 --> 00:18:22,446
Will you chill out
with the hot and cold, Hijiri?

352
00:18:24,448 --> 00:18:26,951
[Anzu] He texted a few times yesterday
to check on me.

353
00:18:27,785 --> 00:18:30,412
In his own way, he's making sure I'm okay.

354
00:18:30,496 --> 00:18:31,956
ARE YOU OKAY?
IF YOU ARE OKAY, IT'S FINE

355
00:18:33,082 --> 00:18:36,168
[Anzu] I was just thinking about
what I might be able to do

356
00:18:36,252 --> 00:18:38,379
to, uh, help out a friend of mine.

357
00:18:38,462 --> 00:18:40,464
[soft piano music]

358
00:18:42,216 --> 00:18:44,093
[Hijiri] Well,
as long as you're near them,

359
00:18:44,176 --> 00:18:45,845
I'm sure everything will be all right.

360
00:18:47,138 --> 00:18:48,097
Huh?

361
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:55,146
Wait, what?
So that's what you think about me, huh?

362
00:18:55,229 --> 00:18:56,355
Please don't touch me.

363
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:03,863
Aw, shoot. Hoshino already left, huh?

364
00:19:04,363 --> 00:19:06,323
[manager] Well, she forgot her phone here.

365
00:19:07,950 --> 00:19:10,911
If we run, we can catch her.
I'll just send Tsuchiya.

366
00:19:10,995 --> 00:19:12,746
-[snaps fingers]
-How can I help, sir?

367
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:14,748
[manager]
I've been wondering all this time,

368
00:19:14,832 --> 00:19:17,042
what country are you the prince of,
Mr. Koganei?

369
00:19:17,710 --> 00:19:20,796
[Saki] Hi there. Is Anzu in the back?

370
00:19:21,463 --> 00:19:22,756
-No, she just left.
-[door closes]

371
00:19:23,382 --> 00:19:27,386
What? She sent a text asking me
to come pick her up with my brother.

372
00:19:28,345 --> 00:19:29,763
-[Saki's brother grunts]
-[Saki] Uh…

373
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:36,937
Oh, shoot! Did I forget my phone?
[groans in frustration]

374
00:19:37,021 --> 00:19:39,315
What a drag. Oh?

375
00:19:39,398 --> 00:19:41,400
[suspenseful music]

376
00:19:41,901 --> 00:19:42,902
Hey.

377
00:19:43,402 --> 00:19:45,446
[nervous gasp]

378
00:19:46,405 --> 00:19:48,741
[punk 1] We're gonna need you
to come over here with us.

379
00:19:48,824 --> 00:19:51,118
[Anzu] Huh? What? Who are you?

380
00:19:51,202 --> 00:19:52,328
[punk 1] I'm sorry, girl,

381
00:19:52,411 --> 00:19:55,956
but we were told to make sure
you can't be out in public.

382
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:58,751
-[Anzu groaning]
-[thuds]

383
00:20:01,337 --> 00:20:02,880
[yelps]

384
00:20:03,422 --> 00:20:04,256
[punk 1] Huh?

385
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,507
-[bone cracks]
-Huh?

386
00:20:05,591 --> 00:20:06,759
[grunts]

387
00:20:08,219 --> 00:20:11,263
What are you doing? Get away from Anzu.

388
00:20:12,014 --> 00:20:13,015
Uh, Junta…

389
00:20:13,098 --> 00:20:14,767
-Damn it…
-[punk 1 groans]

390
00:20:15,351 --> 00:20:17,228
Who the hell is this brat?

391
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:19,188
[punk 2 grunts, groans]

392
00:20:21,023 --> 00:20:21,941
-[thuds]
-[Anzu gasps]

393
00:20:22,858 --> 00:20:23,859
Ryuya!

394
00:20:23,943 --> 00:20:25,861
-[groans]
-Tonta, stay out of it!

395
00:20:25,945 --> 00:20:27,947
-You can get kicked off the team!
-[grunting]

396
00:20:28,989 --> 00:20:30,407
[Anzu gasping]

397
00:20:31,367 --> 00:20:33,369
[punks groaning]

398
00:20:34,620 --> 00:20:36,622
Hey, back off!

399
00:20:37,706 --> 00:20:38,707
[surprised gasps]

400
00:20:38,791 --> 00:20:41,460
Pardon, I'm not sure what's going on here,

401
00:20:41,543 --> 00:20:43,504
but I'm afraid I'll have to stop you.

402
00:20:43,587 --> 00:20:45,256
-[groans]
-[bones crack]

403
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,133
Mr. Tsuchiya!

404
00:20:48,217 --> 00:20:51,804
Miss Hoshino, my sincerest apologies.
I'm sorry to intrude.

405
00:20:52,388 --> 00:20:54,515
But I'm here to deliver
something you forgot.

406
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:56,350
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

407
00:20:56,976 --> 00:20:58,352
[groans]

408
00:20:58,435 --> 00:20:59,812
The hell, man?

409
00:21:01,605 --> 00:21:02,648
[Ryuya clears throat]

410
00:21:05,150 --> 00:21:07,987
Hold up, you guys. Naoki, is that you?

411
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:10,072
[gasps]
Mr. Takamine!

412
00:21:10,739 --> 00:21:12,866
Wanna tell me what the hell you're doing?

413
00:21:12,950 --> 00:21:14,576
I'm so sorry.

414
00:21:15,327 --> 00:21:18,872
[Naoki] We had no choice.
This crazy chick threatens us.

415
00:21:19,665 --> 00:21:21,667
[foreboding music]

416
00:21:25,170 --> 00:21:26,630
Was she around 20?

417
00:21:26,714 --> 00:21:29,133
Did she have really dark hair,
to about here?

418
00:21:29,216 --> 00:21:30,634
Yeah, that's right.

419
00:21:30,718 --> 00:21:31,885
[gasps]

420
00:21:31,969 --> 00:21:34,888
[Saki's brother] You two ain't getting off
easy for this, you hear?

421
00:21:35,472 --> 00:21:36,849
Right, Shades-y?

422
00:21:37,349 --> 00:21:38,726
I'm sorry. Shades-y, you said?

423
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:41,478
Oh, brother,
was that supposed to be clever?

424
00:21:41,562 --> 00:21:42,479
Um…

425
00:21:42,980 --> 00:21:44,732
[insects chirruping]

426
00:21:45,774 --> 00:21:47,901
[Anzu] I'm okay, thanks to you guys.

427
00:21:48,694 --> 00:21:51,822
I just can't believe everyone showed up
with such great timing.

428
00:21:51,905 --> 00:21:55,409
[Ryuya] Well, I mean, I did get
that super random text from you.

429
00:21:55,492 --> 00:21:57,077
What? A text?

430
00:21:57,161 --> 00:21:59,747
[Saki] Yeah, and you messaged me
to bring my brother,

431
00:21:59,830 --> 00:22:01,915
-so I didn't know what to expect.
-Hmm?

432
00:22:01,999 --> 00:22:02,916
WANT TO GO TO THE ARCADE AFTER?

433
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,293
[Anzu] Wait.

434
00:22:04,376 --> 00:22:05,210
WHEN DO YOU GET OFF?

435
00:22:05,294 --> 00:22:06,920
I don't remember sending any of these.

436
00:22:07,504 --> 00:22:09,048
I don't think you're safe here.

437
00:22:09,131 --> 00:22:11,508
You should really hurry home
and try to get some rest.

438
00:22:11,592 --> 00:22:14,428
Oh? Yeah, I'll go do that.

439
00:22:15,554 --> 00:22:17,848
Thank you all so much, seriously.

440
00:22:19,016 --> 00:22:21,435
[Arisa] What? I honestly can't believe it.

441
00:22:21,518 --> 00:22:24,438
[Anzu] I know, but thankfully
nothing serious happened.

442
00:22:25,022 --> 00:22:26,732
I should leave. I mean,

443
00:22:27,566 --> 00:22:29,943
after all that, I can't stay here.

444
00:22:30,611 --> 00:22:31,487
[sighs]

445
00:22:34,364 --> 00:22:35,699
-[Anzu] I won't let you.
-[gasps]

446
00:22:36,283 --> 00:22:37,868
-[Anzu] You shouldn't have to suffer…
-Mm.

447
00:22:37,951 --> 00:22:39,787
…just because someone like her is
out there.

448
00:22:40,287 --> 00:22:42,289
Let's figure this out as a team.

449
00:22:44,416 --> 00:22:45,542
[exhales deeply]

450
00:22:46,543 --> 00:22:47,461
[Tsukasa] Thanks.

451
00:22:51,465 --> 00:22:53,467
Bad moods are a big no-no!

452
00:22:53,550 --> 00:22:57,387
This cute boy right here will help you
get into a good one!

453
00:22:58,097 --> 00:23:00,641
Kick rocks. You embody my negativity.

454
00:23:01,308 --> 00:23:04,144
Oh wow, you're hard.
[humming happily]

455
00:23:04,728 --> 00:23:07,231
[Rio] You know, I got you out
of that sticky situation

456
00:23:07,314 --> 00:23:09,316
by sending those texts to everyone
with your phone.

457
00:23:09,399 --> 00:23:11,819
What, it was you? You send the texts?

458
00:23:11,902 --> 00:23:12,986
[Rio] Yes, ma'am.

459
00:23:13,487 --> 00:23:15,197
I set the whole thing up,

460
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:18,367
so that all of the pawns
would come running to protect you.

461
00:23:18,450 --> 00:23:19,910
Don't you dare call them "pawns"!

462
00:23:20,994 --> 00:23:22,162
[sighs]

463
00:23:23,205 --> 00:23:26,166
Anyway, thank you.
You really saved my life.

464
00:23:26,250 --> 00:23:27,918
First time I'm grateful for you.

465
00:23:28,001 --> 00:23:29,670
An ant's booger's worth.

466
00:23:29,753 --> 00:23:31,463
A microscopic level, oh!

467
00:23:32,589 --> 00:23:36,635
[Anzu] Look, if you're a wizard,
can't you do something about this stalker?

468
00:23:36,718 --> 00:23:40,013
Like, put up a barrier, maybe,
that keeps her from finding Kazuki.

469
00:23:40,931 --> 00:23:42,099
Hmm.

470
00:23:42,683 --> 00:23:44,601
I'm only able to use my magic,

471
00:23:44,685 --> 00:23:47,521
if it contributes
to your romantic relationship somehow.

472
00:23:48,355 --> 00:23:49,523
Here's the thing.

473
00:23:49,606 --> 00:23:50,691
If you do nothing about it,

474
00:23:50,774 --> 00:23:53,527
then you would be exposing me to danger,
am I right?

475
00:23:53,610 --> 00:23:54,987
Whoa…

476
00:23:55,571 --> 00:23:58,907
Well, if it's true you're going
to be exposed to future danger,

477
00:23:59,491 --> 00:24:02,661
[Rio] I'll just have to remove Kazuki
from your potential partner options.

478
00:24:03,704 --> 00:24:04,913
[groans]

479
00:24:04,997 --> 00:24:07,457
[Rio] Gotta eliminate those risky pawns,
am I right?

480
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,001
[Anzu grunts]

481
00:24:11,879 --> 00:24:12,713
Heh?

482
00:24:12,796 --> 00:24:14,214
-[Anzu grunts]
-[Rio] No!

483
00:24:16,175 --> 00:24:18,969
-[squeaks]
-[yells]

484
00:24:19,970 --> 00:24:22,222
I'm done talking
to anyone without a heart.

485
00:24:22,306 --> 00:24:23,640
[Anzu] Get out.

486
00:24:23,724 --> 00:24:24,558
[door closes]

487
00:24:25,767 --> 00:24:27,060
[Rio] Aw, jeez.

488
00:24:33,275 --> 00:24:36,486
Well, now I won't be able
to use my magic again for a while.

489
00:24:38,113 --> 00:24:40,240
-[phone keyboard clicking]
-[door opens]

490
00:24:41,783 --> 00:24:43,327
I can't fall asleep.

491
00:24:44,328 --> 00:24:45,662
[Junta groans]
I'm really thirsty.

492
00:24:48,332 --> 00:24:51,668
Sorry Junta, for putting Hoshino
in all this danger.

493
00:24:52,252 --> 00:24:53,754
Why are you apologizing?

494
00:24:54,504 --> 00:24:57,007
[Junta sighs]
You shouldn't feel responsible

495
00:24:57,090 --> 00:24:58,008
for any of this stuff.

496
00:24:58,800 --> 00:24:59,760
Hmm.

497
00:25:00,594 --> 00:25:04,139
Luckily, Anzu didn't get hurt
this time around.

498
00:25:04,848 --> 00:25:06,975
But I won't let that stalker do this.

499
00:25:07,851 --> 00:25:12,105
I swear, if she threatens Anzu again,
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

500
00:25:13,774 --> 00:25:16,109
If it gets me kicked off the team,
then so be it.

501
00:25:17,736 --> 00:25:19,488
I've made up my mind now,

502
00:25:20,113 --> 00:25:23,617
and I have no regrets.
It's got nothing to do with you.

503
00:25:26,036 --> 00:25:29,498
[Junta] Truth is, the reason
I started playing baseball was…

504
00:25:30,123 --> 00:25:32,584
-What kind of guys do you like, Anzu?
-Hmm?

505
00:25:32,668 --> 00:25:34,044
Hmm…

506
00:25:34,753 --> 00:25:36,546
Someone who's super athletic!

507
00:25:36,630 --> 00:25:38,423
[fighting grunts]
And can beat the boss!

508
00:25:38,507 --> 00:25:40,050
[Junta] Those were her exact words.

509
00:25:40,133 --> 00:25:43,178
[zapping on TV]

510
00:25:43,262 --> 00:25:45,681
[Anzu] Tonta, you got
great hand-eye coordination.

511
00:25:45,764 --> 00:25:47,516
-Would rock at baseball, I bet.
-[gasps]

512
00:25:48,141 --> 00:25:51,061
[Junta] So, I picked up baseball
in middle school.

513
00:25:51,144 --> 00:25:52,938
Because of what Anzu said.

514
00:25:53,021 --> 00:25:54,564
[muffled laughter]

515
00:25:54,648 --> 00:25:56,108
Hey dude, don't laugh.

516
00:25:56,692 --> 00:25:59,528
No, I'm sorry. I'm sure she has no idea

517
00:25:59,611 --> 00:26:01,905
she was so influential, that's all.

518
00:26:07,911 --> 00:26:09,538
Totally. Oh?

519
00:26:10,330 --> 00:26:11,790
Hi.
[chuckles]

520
00:26:13,292 --> 00:26:15,252
[ominous music]

521
00:26:16,878 --> 00:26:19,381
[Hijiri] Has everything been okay
since the night we spoke?

522
00:26:19,464 --> 00:26:20,299
CONBINI MART

523
00:26:21,174 --> 00:26:22,175
Mm-hm.

524
00:26:22,259 --> 00:26:24,303
[Anzu] Haven't had anything happen since.

525
00:26:24,386 --> 00:26:27,848
[Anzu] Kazuki and his sister
are gonna walk me home after work today.

526
00:26:28,807 --> 00:26:32,769
That's good. But if you ever need
Tsuchiya, you can ask any time.

527
00:26:33,395 --> 00:26:34,604
[chuckles]

528
00:26:34,688 --> 00:26:37,399
Well, thank you.
And if the boss was here, he'd say,

529
00:26:37,482 --> 00:26:39,735
[imitates manager]
"In what country are you an oil tycoon?"

530
00:26:39,818 --> 00:26:41,695
[in normal voice]
You know he'd say that, right?

531
00:26:41,778 --> 00:26:43,155
Yeah, he asked me already.

532
00:26:43,655 --> 00:26:45,282
[Hijiri chuckles]

533
00:26:45,365 --> 00:26:47,951
[Hijiri] Anyway, not even a king
nor an emperor

534
00:26:48,035 --> 00:26:50,078
would interest you at all, right?

535
00:26:50,162 --> 00:26:52,581
Huh? Well, yeah.

536
00:26:53,373 --> 00:26:54,249
[chuckles softly]

537
00:26:56,710 --> 00:26:58,670
All right, break's over now.

538
00:26:58,754 --> 00:27:01,340
-Yeah, I'm gonna head home.
-Good night.

539
00:27:06,011 --> 00:27:07,846
-[Yukana] Miss Hoshino.
-Huh?

540
00:27:07,929 --> 00:27:09,348
[Anzu gasps]

541
00:27:09,431 --> 00:27:11,433
[eerie music]

542
00:27:13,393 --> 00:27:15,354
Excuse me. You got a minute?

543
00:27:16,355 --> 00:27:18,815
[Anzu] Kishi. Oh, shoot.

544
00:27:18,899 --> 00:27:20,859
Tsukasa and Arisa are coming to get me.

545
00:27:21,443 --> 00:27:23,570
They'll be here any sec.
I can't let them see her.

546
00:27:23,653 --> 00:27:24,696
What do you want?

547
00:27:26,114 --> 00:27:27,866
[Yukana] I have something for you.

548
00:27:28,658 --> 00:27:29,868
[Anzu gasps in fear]

549
00:27:29,951 --> 00:27:31,370
[blood splats]

550
00:27:33,413 --> 00:27:34,956
A fanfare, please!

551
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:37,125
And a big congratulations!

552
00:27:37,209 --> 00:27:39,378
Did you fall for my little trick?

553
00:27:39,461 --> 00:27:42,547
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

554
00:27:42,631 --> 00:27:46,301
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

555
00:27:46,385 --> 00:27:49,054
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

556
00:27:49,137 --> 00:27:51,431
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

557
00:27:51,515 --> 00:27:54,101
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

558
00:27:54,184 --> 00:27:56,103
So I can make sure I get paid.

559
00:27:56,186 --> 00:27:58,271
[closing theme music]

560
00:27:58,355 --> 00:27:59,272
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

561
00:28:01,775 --> 00:28:02,734
♪ Let's go! ♪

562
00:28:05,028 --> 00:28:06,154
♪ Lo-love! ♪

563
00:28:08,490 --> 00:28:09,324
♪ Here we go! ♪

564
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:04,851
